WHILE LOOPS

COLLATZ sequence:
    .Accepts a number from the user.
    .Generates Collatz sequence: n → n/2 (if even) or 3n+1 (if odd).
    .Uses while loop until number reaches 1.
    .Prints each step in the sequence.

 DICE:
    .Simulates rolling a dice multiple times.
    .Uses while loop to continue rolling until a condition.
    .Generates random number between 1–6 each roll.
    .Prints each dice roll.
    .Updates cumulative score or count.  

DIGITAL CLOCK:
    .Simulates a digital clock with hours, minutes, seconds.
    .Uses nested while loops for time increments.
    .Prints time in HH:MM:SS format.
    .Stops after a certain hour or condition.

SPEED CHECK:
    .Measures typing speed of the user.
    .Uses while loop to check user input against target sentence.
    .Tracks time taken.
    .Calculates words per minute (WPM).
    .Prints result and feedback.

